msgid "Item preview drawer on the lists"
msgstr "Prévia do item em gaveta nas listas"

#: functions/customizer/tainacan-interface-features.php:27
msgid "A click on an item of a list opens a side panel with its image, description and metadata, with previous and next. Ctrl+click still opens the item page."
